  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British Academy Coherence &amp; Impact - Challenge-led grants: Early Childhood Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects funded under this programme aim to provide critical knowledge to inform policy-making in the education and broader learning domain, while recognising the necessary interplay of education with health, nutrition, gender equality and other disciplines and sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme supports research geared towards informing policy-making in the education and broader learning domain in the Global South.</narrative>
  </description>
